        <h2>Payout Settled — Money On Its Way 💸</h2>

        <p>Hello {{name}},</p>

        <p>
            Your earnings have been settled by RentEase and the net amount has been
            released to your registered bank account. Here is the full breakdown of
            this payout.
        </p>

        <div class="info-box">
            <h3>Payout Summary</h3>
            <p><strong>Payout Number:</strong> {{payoutNumber}}</p>
            <p><strong>Receipt Number:</strong> {{receiptNumber}}</p>
            <p><strong>Business:</strong> {{businessName}}</p>
            <p><strong>Payout Date:</strong> {{payoutDate}}</p>
            <p><strong>Period Covered:</strong> {{periodText}}</p>
            <p><strong>Settlements Included:</strong> {{entriesCount}}</p>
            <p><strong>Payment Mode:</strong> {{methodLabel}}</p>
        </div>

        <h3>How your net amount was calculated</h3>

        <table>
            <tr>
                <th>Gross Earnings</th>
                <td>{{currency}} {{grossAmount}}</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <th>Platform Commission</th>
                <td>- {{currency}} {{commission}}</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <th>Platform Fee</th>
                <td>- {{currency}} {{platformFee}}</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <th>Tax Deducted</th>
                <td>- {{currency}} {{tax}}</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <th>Payout Processing Fee</th>
                <td>- {{currency}} {{processingFee}}</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <th>Total Deductions</th>
                <td>- {{currency}} {{totalDeductions}}</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <th>Net Amount Credited</th>
                <td><strong>{{currency}} {{netAmount}}</strong></td>
            </tr>
        </table>

        <div class="info-box">
            <h3>Credited To</h3>
            {{#if hasBank}}
            <p><strong>Account Holder:</strong> {{accountHolderName}}</p>
            <p><strong>Account Number:</strong> {{accountNumberMasked}}</p>
            <p><strong>IFSC:</strong> {{ifscCode}}</p>
            <p><strong>Bank:</strong> {{bankName}}</p>
            {{/if}}
            {{#if hasUpi}}
            <p><strong>UPI ID:</strong> {{upiId}}</p>
            {{/if}}
            {{#if utr}}
            <p><strong>Bank Reference (UTR):</strong> {{utr}}</p>
            {{/if}}
        </div>

        <center>
            <a href="{{payoutsUrl}}" class="button">View Payout History</a>
        </center>

        <p>
            The commission, platform fee and tax lines above are shown for your
            records — they were already deducted before the net amount was credited,
            so there is nothing further to pay.
        </p>

        <p>
            Every payment that made up this payout is itemised in your vendor
            dashboard under Payouts. If any figure looks wrong, contact our vendor
            support team within 7 days with the payout number above.
        </p>

        <p>Thanks for being part of RentEase!</p>

        <p>The RentEase Team</p>
